  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 408.01 Projects In Priority Resource Areas (PRAs)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 408.01 Projects In Priority Resource Areas (PRAs). A project shall be classified as major impact if any part of the project impacts a priority resource area (PRA), which classification shall take precedence over any lower classification, unless the project:\n\n(a) Is subject to a lower classification under Env-Wt 407.02; or\n\n(b) Qualifies for a PTE under Env-Wt 407.04.\n\nSource. #12804, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt400.html"
}
